{
  "subject": "Share your favourite prompts and understand the essential ingredients to crafting the perfect prompt",
  "body": {
    "contentType": "html",
    "content": "<attachment id=\"ba9e630a0f06446f93b2eedaf8c608a1\"></attachment>In this channel you will be able to learn practical guidance of prompting, understand use cases and be first to understand new scenarios for Microsoft 365 Copilot capabilities.<br><br>We believe the best way to learn is from each other! So please use this space to share your experiences, where are your finding the best productivity gains and help us build a library of use cases for the rest of our organisation.<br><br>Explore the resources in the tabs above and reach out to your Project team with any questions here in this channel."
  },
  "attachments": [
      {
          "id": "ba9e630a0f06446f93b2eedaf8c608a1",
          "contentType": "application/vnd.microsoft.teams.messaging-announcementBanner",
          "contentUrl": null,
          "content": "{\"title\":\"Welcome to Prompting 101\",\"cardImageType\":\"colorTheme\",\"cardImageDetails\":{\"colorTheme\":\"rose\"}}",
          "name": null,
          "thumbnailUrl": null
      }
  ]
}


{
  "subject": "Resolve issues, decide policy and coordinate with program leaders",
  "body": {
    "contentType": "html",
    "content": "<attachment id=\"ba9e630a0f06446f93b2eedaf8c608a1\"></attachment>This private channel is designed for early adoption change and technical leaders to coordinate on issues before sharing with the broad user audience that will also be included in this team.  Conversations here are only viewable by private channel members.  Files stored in this area are not accessible to general team members. <br><br>✔️ Make sure you download the <b><a href='https://adoption.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/success-kit/'>Customer Success Kit</a></b> to accelerate your time to value with Copilot. <br><br>✔️ For more information on data privacy please visit <a href='https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365-copilot/microsoft-365-copilot-privacy'>Data, Privacy, and Security for Microsoft Copilot for Microsoft 365</a>. "
  },
  "attachments": [
      {
          "id": "ba9e630a0f06446f93b2eedaf8c608a1",
          "contentType": "application/vnd.microsoft.teams.messaging-announcementBanner",
