          "content": "{\"title\":\"Core Team Conversation\",\"cardImageType\":\"colorTheme\",\"cardImageDetails\":{\"colorTheme\":\"oceanGreen\"}}",
          "name": null,
          "thumbnailUrl": null
      }
  ]
}


{
  "subject": "Ask questions of your peers, leaders and our Copilot Enablement Team",
  "body": {
    "contentType": "html",
    "content": "<attachment id=\"ba9e630a0f06446f93b2eedaf8c608a1\"></attachment>Welcome to your private lounge to explore useful scenarios with Microsoft 365 Copilot.  We value your time and feedback.  Please ask your questions here or provide us with your insights so that we can continuously improve your experience and the effectiveness of our Copilot capabilites in your business."
  },
  "attachments": [
      {
          "id": "ba9e630a0f06446f93b2eedaf8c608a1",
