      }
  ]
}


                {
                  "subject": "Resources and tools to help you get the most from Microsoft 365 Copilot",
                  "body": {
                    "contentType": "html",
                    "content": "<attachment id=\"ba9e630a0f06446f93b2eedaf8c608a1\"></attachment>Welcome to the Microsoft 365 Center of Excellence team.  This template was configured for your use as you deploy, configure and use Microsoft 365 Copilot features.  It leverages best practices from the Microsoft 365 Adoption Framework and can be tailored to your own best practices and team culture.<br/><br/>Each channel has a specific purpose in program operations.<br>
                    <ol><li><b>General</b> - Introduction to the Copilot Center of Excellence</li>
<li><b>Ask Us Anything</b> - Ask your Champions & Project Team technical or adoption questions, view Copilot training links and best practices, look at what's coming on the Copilot roadmap</li>
<li><b>Share your Prompt</b> - Everything and anything to do with Prompting! Share your favourite prompts and use cases, find out more information on prompt engineering and the top 4 ingredients of a prompt</li>
</ol>"
                  },
                  "attachments": [
                      {
